<tt xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.340"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">铁弹便是正义的证明</text><text for="L2">贯穿而过，便更接近英雄</text><text for="L3">闭上双眼，试着触摸</text><text for="L4">那是与我形体相同、体温相同的恶魔</text><text for="L5">我不行，那家伙就可以吗？</text><text for="L6">明明只是隔着一堵墙</text><text for="L7">别哀叹生来便注定的命运</text><text for="L8">因为我们每个人都自由</text><text for="L9">若拥有鸟儿般的翅膀</text><text for="L10">便能去往任何地方，可是</text><text for="L11">若没有可以归去的地方</text><text for="L12">想必哪里也去不了</text><text for="L13">我不愿只是活着</text><text for="L14">世界如此残酷，即便如此，我仍爱你</text><text for="L15">无论牺牲什么，我仍要守护你</text><text for="L16">即使这是错误，我也绝不怀疑</text><text for="L17">所谓正确，就是坚定地相信自己</text><text for="L18">铁雨纷纷落下的景象</text><text for="L19">在电视里看去，竟像是一部电影</text><text for="L20">战争什么的，不过是愚蠢的暴行</text><text for="L21">是与我无关的、陌生国度的故事</text><text for="L22">既然如此，我为何会憎恨那家伙</text><text for="L23">为何这份阴暗的情感藏也藏不住</text><text for="L24">我连理由都解释不了</text><text for="L25">我们竟如此矛盾重重</text><text for="L26">就连这些话，一旦被翻译</text><text for="L27">也传达不了真正的含义</text><text for="L28">我所相信的，只有睁开双眼后</text><text for="L29">亲身触碰到的世界</text><text for="L30">我不愿只是活着</text><text for="L31">世界如此残酷，即便如此，我仍爱你</text><text for="L32">无论牺牲什么，我也要守护你</text><text for="L33">被我选中之人的身影，遭我舍弃之物的尸骸</text><text for="L34">我意识到，自己心中滋长的是恶魔之子</text><text for="L35">正义的背后、牺牲之中，心里住着恶魔之子</text></translation></translations><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>ヒグチアイ</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="悪魔の子"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ヒグチアイ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="最悪最愛"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1609932617"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:47.673"><div begin="1.112" end="13.883"><p begin="1.112" end="3.854" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.112" end="1.664">鉄の</span><span begin="1.664" end="2.464">弾が</span> <span begin="2.464" end="3.130">正義の</span><span begin="3.130" end="3.854">証明</span></p><p begin="3.864" end="6.523" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.864" end="4.731">貫けば</span> <span begin="4.838" end="5.656">英雄に</span><span begin="5.656" end="6.523">近づいた</span></p><p begin="6.523" end="9.067" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.523" end="7.251">その目を</span><span begin="7.251" end="7.849">閉じて</span> <span begin="7.849" end="8.519">触れてみ</span><span begin="8.519" end="9.067">れば</span></p><p begin="9.177" end="13.883" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.177" end="9.684">同じ</span><span begin="9.684" end="10.217">形</span> <span begin="10.217" end="10.817">同じ</span><span begin="10.817" end="12.001">体温の悪</span><span begin="12.001" end="13.883">魔</span></p></div><div begin="14.519" end="26.333"><p begin="14.519" end="17.078" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.519" end="15.482">僕はダメ</span><span begin="15.482" end="15.831">で</span> <span begin="15.831" end="16.780">あいつはいい</span><span begin="16.780" end="17.078">の？</span></p><p begin="17.188" end="19.873" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.188" end="17.652">そこに</span><span begin="17.652" end="18.531">壁が</span><span begin="18.531" end="19.873">あっただけなのに</span></p><p begin="19.883" end="22.499" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.883" end="20.491">生まれて</span><span begin="20.491" end="21.190">しまった</span> <span begin="21.190" end="21.656">運命</span><span begin="21.656" end="22.499">嘆くな</span></p><p begin="22.509" end="26.333" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.509" end="23.000">僕ら</span><span begin="23.000" end="23.850">はみんな</span> <span begin="23.850" end="24.544">自由</span><span begin="24.544" end="25.349">なんだか</span><span begin="25.349" end="26.333">ら</span></p></div><div begin="26.343" end="46.438"><p begin="26.343" end="31.547" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.343" end="27.071">鳥</span><span begin="27.071" end="28.071">のよう</span><span begin="28.071" end="28.860">に</span> <span begin="29.087" end="30.737">羽があれ</span><span begin="30.737" end="31.547">ば</span></p><p begin="31.647" end="36.858" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.647" end="32.714">どこへ</span><span begin="32.714" end="33.881">だって</span><span begin="34.047" end="35.281">行け</span><span begin="35.281" end="36.017">るけ</span><span begin="36.017" end="36.858">ど</span></p><p begin="36.968" end="40.999" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.968" end="38.045">帰る</span><span begin="38.045" end="38.712">場所</span><span begin="38.712" end="39.472">が</span> <span begin="39.730" end="40.999">なければ</span></p><p begin="41.009" end="46.438" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.009" end="42.718">きっとど</span><span begin="42.718" end="43.236">こ</span><span begin="43.236" end="44.036">へも行</span><span begin="44.036" end="45.204">けな</span><span begin="45.204" end="46.438">い</span></p></div><div begin="46.448" end="51.663"><p begin="46.448" end="51.663" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.448" end="47.171">ただ</span><span begin="47.171" end="47.787">ただ</span><span begin="47.787" end="48.085">生</span><span begin="48.085" end="49.336">きるのは</span><span begin="49.336" end="50.120">嫌</span><span begin="50.120" end="51.663">だ</span></p></div><div begin="51.843" end="1:24.741"><p begin="51.843" end="1:02.574" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.843" end="53.849">世界は</span><span begin="54.091" end="54.757">残</span><span begin="54.757" end="56.043">酷</span><span begin="56.043" end="57.118">だ</span> <span begin="57.376" end="59.169">それでも</span><span begin="59.376" end="1:00.341">君を</span><span begin="1:00.341" end="1:01.325">愛す</span><span begin="1:01.325" end="1:02.574">よ</span></p><p begin="1:02.674" end="1:12.509" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.674" end="1:03.386">な</span><span begin="1:03.386" end="1:03.952">にを</span><span begin="1:03.952" end="1:04.653">犠</span><span begin="1:04.653" end="1:05.352">牲</span><span begin="1:05.352" end="1:06.217">に</span><span begin="1:06.217" end="1:06.748">して</span><span begin="1:06.748" end="1:07.749">も</span> <span begin="1:07.999" end="1:08.650">そ</span><span begin="1:08.650" end="1:09.864">れでも</span><span begin="1:10.066" end="1:11.015">君を</span><span begin="1:11.015" end="1:12.509">守るよ</span></p><p begin="1:12.619" end="1:17.700" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.619" end="1:13.361">間違い</span><span begin="1:13.361" end="1:15.086">だとしても</span> <span begin="1:15.377" end="1:16.027">疑っ</span><span begin="1:16.027" end="1:17.700">たりしない</span></p><p begin="1:17.810" end="1:24.741" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.810" end="1:18.741">正しさと</span><span begin="1:18.741" end="1:19.045">は</span> <span begin="1:19.255" end="1:20.410">自分のこと</span> <span begin="1:20.522" end="1:21.030">強く</span><span begin="1:21.030" end="1:22.655">信じること</span><span begin="1:22.655" end="1:24.741">だ</span></p></div><div begin="1:33.187" end="1:57.966"><p begin="1:33.187" end="1:35.790" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.187" end="1:33.713">鉄の</span><span begin="1:33.713" end="1:34.494">雨が</span> <span begin="1:34.494" end="1:35.195">降り散る</span><span begin="1:35.195" end="1:35.790">情景</span></p><p begin="1:35.800" end="1:38.525" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.800" end="1:36.952">テレビの中</span> <span begin="1:36.952" end="1:37.536">映画</span><span begin="1:37.536" end="1:38.525">に見えたんだ</span></p><p begin="1:38.535" end="1:41.147" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.535" end="1:39.842">戦争なんて</span> <span begin="1:39.842" end="1:40.460">愚かな</span><span begin="1:40.460" end="1:41.147">凶暴</span></p><p begin="1:41.157" end="1:43.817" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.157" end="1:42.149">関係ない</span> <span begin="1:42.149" end="1:42.834">知らない</span><span begin="1:42.834" end="1:43.317">国の</span><span begin="1:43.317" end="1:43.817">話</span></p><p begin="1:43.827" end="1:46.426" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.827" end="1:45.152">それならなんで</span> <span begin="1:45.152" end="1:45.619">あいつ</span><span begin="1:45.619" end="1:46.426">憎んで</span></p><p begin="1:46.536" end="1:49.152" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.536" end="1:47.520">黒い気持ち</span> <span begin="1:47.520" end="1:48.152">隠し</span><span begin="1:48.152" end="1:49.152">きれない理由</span></p><p begin="1:49.162" end="1:51.726" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.162" end="1:50.514">説明だって</span> <span begin="1:50.514" end="1:51.171">できやし</span><span begin="1:51.171" end="1:51.726">ないんだ</span></p><p begin="1:51.836" end="1:57.966" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.836" end="1:53.100">僕らはなんて</span> <span begin="1:53.255" end="1:53.804">矛盾</span><span begin="1:53.804" end="1:54.689">ばっかなん</span><span begin="1:54.689" end="1:57.966">だ</span></p></div><div begin="2:16.981" end="2:37.084"><p begin="2:16.981" end="2:22.254" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.981" end="2:17.669">この</span><span begin="2:17.669" end="2:18.704">言葉</span><span begin="2:18.704" end="2:19.423">も</span> <span begin="2:19.685" end="2:21.387">訳されれ</span><span begin="2:21.387" end="2:22.254">ば</span></p><p begin="2:22.324" end="2:27.570" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.324" end="2:23.666">本当の</span><span begin="2:23.666" end="2:25.266">意味は</span><span begin="2:25.266" end="2:25.815">伝</span><span begin="2:25.815" end="2:26.615">わら</span><span begin="2:26.615" end="2:27.570">ない</span></p><p begin="2:27.620" end="2:33.165" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.620" end="2:29.356">信じるの</span><span begin="2:29.356" end="2:30.084">は</span> <span begin="2:30.340" end="2:31.673">その目を</span><span begin="2:31.673" end="2:33.165">開いて</span></p><p begin="2:33.175" end="2:37.084" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.175" end="2:34.444">触れた</span><span begin="2:34.444" end="2:35.879">世界だ</span><span begin="2:35.879" end="2:37.084">け</span></p></div><div begin="2:37.194" end="2:44.917"><p begin="2:37.194" end="2:44.917" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.194" end="2:37.834">ただ</span><span begin="2:37.834" end="2:38.485">ただ</span><span begin="2:38.485" end="2:40.898">生きるのは嫌</span><span begin="2:40.898" end="2:44.917">だ</span></p></div><div begin="2:45.697" end="3:24.909"><p begin="2:45.697" end="2:56.318" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.697" end="2:47.703">世界は</span><span begin="2:47.945" end="2:48.611">残</span><span begin="2:48.611" end="2:49.897">酷</span><span begin="2:49.897" end="2:50.972">だ</span> <span begin="2:51.230" end="2:53.023">それでも</span><span begin="2:53.230" end="2:54.195">君を</span><span begin="2:54.195" end="2:55.179">愛す</span><span begin="2:55.179" end="2:56.318">よ</span></p><p begin="2:56.378" end="3:06.213" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.378" end="2:57.090">な</span><span begin="2:57.090" end="2:57.656">にを</span><span begin="2:57.656" end="2:58.357">犠</span><span begin="2:58.357" end="2:59.056">牲</span><span begin="2:59.056" end="2:59.996">に</span><span begin="2:59.996" end="3:00.452">して</span><span begin="3:00.452" end="3:01.453">も</span> <span begin="3:01.703" end="3:02.354">そ</span><span begin="3:02.354" end="3:03.568">れでも</span><span begin="3:03.770" end="3:04.719">君を</span><span begin="3:04.719" end="3:06.213">守るよ</span></p><p begin="3:06.301" end="3:11.543" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.301" end="3:07.098">選んだ</span><span begin="3:07.098" end="3:08.133">人の</span><span begin="3:08.133" end="3:08.965">影</span> <span begin="3:08.965" end="3:10.082">捨てたものの</span><span begin="3:10.082" end="3:11.543">屍</span></p><p begin="3:11.613" end="3:16.846" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.613" end="3:12.896">気づいたんだ</span> <span begin="3:12.973" end="3:14.099">自分の中</span> <span begin="3:14.223" end="3:15.071">育つのは</span><span begin="3:15.071" end="3:16.055">悪魔</span><span begin="3:16.055" end="3:16.846">の子</span></p><p begin="3:16.856" end="3:24.909" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.856" end="3:17.541">正義の</span><span begin="3:17.541" end="3:18.096">裏</span> <span begin="3:18.277" end="3:18.893">犠牲の</span><span begin="3:18.893" end="3:19.464">中</span> <span begin="3:19.576" end="3:20.109">心</span><span begin="3:20.109" end="3:20.408">には</span><span begin="3:20.408" end="3:21.774">悪魔の</span><span begin="3:21.774" end="3:24.909">子</span></p></div></body></tt>